resty-cli — copyright and license notice
========================================

The `resty` launcher shipped in this package is a native binary
(flrgh/rusty-cli, see rusty-cli.LICENSE) that replaces, and is a drop-in
reimplementation of, OpenResty's resty-cli. The original resty-cli
copyright and license notice is reproduced below, as required by its
BSD (2-clause) license. Source: https://github.com/openresty/resty-cli

